        "70d55418-3a43-5a8c-810f-5e0f52729d27"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 4,
      "instruction": "Once boiling, reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Allow to cook covered for 18 minutes over low heat, then remove from heat. Leave the lid on for an additional 5 minutes."
    },
    {
      "step_number": 5,
      "instruction": "Open the lid and remove the green onion, Scotch bonnet pepper, and thyme. Fluff the rice and peas with a fork. Serve and enjoy.",
